      "id": "claim_35f696ef353c4eebbebac56dccfaf10d",
      "statement": "The agent is a Code Mode agent: its executeCode tool runs a model-authored module as a disposable Dynamic Worker loaded via env.LOADER.load with globalOutbound null, so executed snippets have no internet access and only the chat's named bindings in env.",
