        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e41adde6ef4f4aa8a22b88c20446f775",
      "statement": "The code-mode worker is hardened with the disallow_importable_env flag (preventing loaded code from calling back into the OS itself), and getEnvForAgent skips binding names failing validateBindingName to avoid prototype pollution in the plain-object env.",
